WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:18.157
days later Zann rushed for the door as soon as school ended.

2
00:00:18.998 --> 00:00:20.819
He heard Mari laugh and call his name.

3
00:00:20.839 --> 00:00:23.541
"Why are you in such a rush?"

4
00:00:23.881 --> 00:00:25.422
she exclaimed, catching up with him.

5
00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:29.525
"I thought I was the only one so eager to escape today!"

6
00:00:29.545 --> 00:00:32.267
"I think everyone is ready to leave."

7
00:00:32.587 --> 00:00:33.428
Zann looked around.

8
00:00:34.292 --> 00:00:37.635
The next week was a school holiday, and all the students looked excited.

9
00:00:37.655 --> 00:00:39.897
"But why are you so eager?

10
00:00:40.197 --> 00:00:41.298
I thought you liked school."

11
00:00:41.318 --> 00:00:42.879
"I do."

12
00:00:43.059 --> 00:00:43.760
Mari smiled.

13
00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:47.283
"But I like working at your parents' lab even more.

14
00:00:48.144 --> 00:00:49.545
Want to walk over there with me?"

15
00:00:49.565 --> 00:00:52.167
"I can't today," Zann said.

16
00:00:52.187 --> 00:00:55.249
"My best friends are arriving later for a visit."

17
00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.852
Zann had been happy ever since receiving the message moth.

18
00:00:59.813 --> 00:01:02.776
Gliss' Uncle Gar was coming to First City for a meeting.

19
00:01:03.736 --> 00:01:06.158
He'd offered to zap Zann's friends there for the party.

20
00:01:07.279 --> 00:01:10.841
That reminded Zann—he'd meant to invite Mari to his party the next day.

21
00:01:11.722 --> 00:01:13.323
He opened his mouth to tell her about it.

22
00:01:13.703 --> 00:01:15.764
But just then Jev walked over.

23
00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:19.327
"Watch out, Mari," Jev said with a smirk.

24
00:01:19.347 --> 00:01:23.930
"If you keep hanging out with Reds, people might start to talk."

25
00:01:24.871 --> 00:01:25.791
Zann frowned at him.

26
00:01:25.811 --> 00:01:27.693
"Mind your own business, Jev."

27
00:01:28.633 --> 00:01:32.436
Then he hurried away, figuring he could send Mari a message moth later.

28
00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:38.002
He didn't want Jev to hear about the party, especially since Gliss would be there.

29
00:01:38.923 --> 00:01:41.724
Even though Gliss was a Red, Jev had always liked her.

30
00:01:45.906 --> 00:01:48.488
When Zann got home, Zing was the only one there.

31
00:01:49.348 --> 00:01:51.129
The dragon looked at him expectantly.

32
00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:52.890
Zann shook his head.

33
00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:54.771
"No park today, little buddy.

34
00:01:55.271 --> 00:01:56.252
We have guests coming."

35
00:01:57.272 --> 00:02:00.134
Zann ducked as Zing shot an angry flame at him.

36
00:02:00.874 --> 00:02:03.776
He felt sorry for the dragon being cooped up in the house all day.

37
00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:07.001
But he knew Zing would be happy when Darb arrived later.

38
00:02:07.862 --> 00:02:10.663
Darb had a special bond with animals, including dragons.

39
00:02:11.704 --> 00:02:14.045
He conjured up some snacks and puckerberry juice.

40
00:02:14.906 --> 00:02:17.847
Then, feeling restless, he wandered around the house.

41
00:02:20.689 --> 00:02:22.650
He was still waiting when his parents came in.

42
00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:25.051
"Are your friends here yet?"

43
00:02:25.391 --> 00:02:26.031
Asta asked.

44
00:02:26.051 --> 00:02:28.653
"Not yet," Zann said.

45
00:02:28.673 --> 00:02:30.594
"You left the lab early?"

46
00:02:31.534 --> 00:02:32.215
Nax nodded.

47
00:02:32.235 --> 00:02:34.396
"We wanted to be here when your friends arrive."

48
00:02:36.241 --> 00:02:38.382
"Besides, we're not needed at the lab."

49
00:02:38.782 --> 00:02:39.462
Asta chuckled.

50
00:02:39.482 --> 00:02:44.985
"Your friend Mari is so enthusiastic, she's doing the work of three people.

51
00:02:45.946 --> 00:02:48.107
I'm glad you reminded us to contact her."

52
00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:51.208
Zann noticed that his father was holding something.

53
00:02:51.228 --> 00:02:53.910
"Isn't that one of your inventions, Dad?"

54
00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.551
"Yes, it's the infusinator."

55
00:02:57.352 --> 00:02:58.132
Nax held it up.

56
00:02:58.152 --> 00:03:01.254
"I thought Darb might want to use it while he's here."

57
00:03:01.274 --> 00:03:05.116
"It will provide him with magic energy," Asta added.

58
00:03:06.012 --> 00:03:10.253
"It uses a magical technique we discovered in a world called Atmo.

59
00:03:11.113 --> 00:03:14.034
Atmo's magic source is the energy in its air.

60
00:03:15.034 --> 00:03:20.536
Some plants and animals can ingest large quantities of that energy and store it for future use.

61
00:03:20.556 --> 00:03:27.618
"We heard Morb used leeches from Atmo to power one of his contraptions," Asta added grimly.

62
00:03:28.518 --> 00:03:29.238
Zann shuddered.

63
00:03:29.678 --> 00:03:31.599
Those blue leeches were horrible!

64
00:03:31.619 --> 00:03:35.060
"Does the infusinator use leeches too?"

65
00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:35.760
he asked.

66
00:03:36.772 --> 00:03:40.474
"No, it's made out of wood from lung trees," Asta said.

67
00:03:40.494 --> 00:03:44.797
"Lung trees have an amazing ability to store magic."

68
00:03:44.817 --> 00:03:49.720
"Darb just needs to breathe in stored energy from this hose," Nax said.

69
00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:53.722
"Then he can use that energy, just like any Magician."

70
00:03:53.742 --> 00:03:58.965
"But we brought back only one piece of wood from the lung tree," Asta said.

71
00:03:58.985 --> 00:04:03.228
"And we've already used a lot of its energy while experimenting.

72
00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:07.521
So Darb will have to use the infusinator carefully."

73
00:04:07.541 --> 00:04:11.123
"I thought it could suck magic out of the air," Zann said.

74
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:13.044
His mother shook her head.

75
00:04:13.064 --> 00:04:14.725
"Only in Atmo.

76
00:04:15.645 --> 00:04:17.606
Magica's energy works differently.

77
00:04:18.486 --> 00:04:20.807
We're still trying to figure out how to refill it."

78
00:04:22.048 --> 00:04:24.949
"We've been experimenting with different techniques," Nax added.

79
00:04:24.969 --> 00:04:30.652
"For now, Darb won't be able to zap long distances or do anything else that requires lots of

80
00:04:30.732 --> 00:04:35.103
energy. But at least he can create food and do other simple tasks."

81
00:04:36.264 --> 00:04:40.288
"Yes, and we hope he'll let us know what he thinks of it," Asta added.

82
00:04:40.308 --> 00:04:51.498
"This infusinator is only a prototype, but if it works well, we—" Perda cried, appearing in front of

83
00:04:51.518 --> 00:04:53.400
them. "We're here!"

84
00:04:54.721 --> 00:04:57.184
Gliss appeared next, holding onto Darb's arm.

85
00:04:58.068 --> 00:05:02.932
Zann grinned, so happy to see the three of them that he hardly knew how to respond.

86
00:05:03.813 --> 00:05:06.735
Zing let out a burst of flame and raced toward Darb.

87
00:05:07.956 --> 00:05:08.577
"Hi, Zing."

88
00:05:08.857 --> 00:05:11.379
Darb smiled and scratched the dragon's scaly head.

89
00:05:11.399 --> 00:05:13.141
"I've missed you."

90
00:05:13.161 --> 00:05:16.844
"I've missed you guys too," Zann blurted out.

91
00:05:16.864 --> 00:05:19.025
"I'm so glad you're here!"

92
00:05:21.147 --> 00:05:24.370
For the next few minutes, the four of them couldn't stop talking.

93
00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:26.912
There was so much to catch up on!

94
00:05:27.944 --> 00:05:30.987
A few times, though, Zann couldn't help feeling a little awkward.

95
00:05:31.928 --> 00:05:34.990
His friends mentioned people and events he didn't know anything about.

96
00:05:36.011 --> 00:05:38.333
But mostly it was great to be with them again.

97
00:05:39.374 --> 00:05:42.377
After a while his parents showed Darb the infusinator.

98
00:05:42.397 --> 00:05:46.840
"We'd love for you to try it out and let us know how it works for you," said

99
00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.302
Nax. "Oh, sure."

100
00:05:49.623 --> 00:05:51.164
Darb seemed a little uncomfortable.

101
00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:55.588
"Thanks." Zann had conjured a bed for Darb.

102
00:05:56.280 --> 00:06:01.642
But since Zann's house was fairly small, Saffa and Staz had offered to let the girls stay with

103
00:06:01.682 --> 00:06:07.543
them. Teplo had offered too, but Zann knew Perda and Gliss wouldn't want to deal with Teplo's cranky

104
00:06:07.583 --> 00:06:11.764
goose. "Let's go to Saffa's so you can settle in," Zann said.

105
00:06:11.784 --> 00:06:14.525
"I'll show you my neighborhood on the way."

106
00:06:17.286 --> 00:06:20.567
The kids headed out, with Zing scurrying along at Darb's heels.

107
00:06:20.587 --> 00:06:24.488
"That's the park Zing and I go to," Zann said, pointing.

108
00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:30.068
"And over there is—" Suddenly that weird feeling struck Zann again.

109
00:06:30.088 --> 00:06:34.995
This time the pain was so strong, it knocked him to the ground!
